      "description": {
        "zh": "网关经纬度所采用的坐标系统，可取值为**WGS_84**, **GCJ_02**。",
        "en": "The coordinate system used for the longitude and latitude of the gateway. Valid values: **WGS_84** and **GCJ_02**."
      }
